    "detailed_description": "For a whole decade, the whereabouts of an abandoned underground mining facility has remained a mystery... until now. You had a lead, to investigate a specific mountain range in Arizona. The fate of the expedition is up to your skills as an explorer, and the trials of the caverns below.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Feel the Immersion</h2>From the outside air of Arizonas' mountain ranges, to the claustraphobic cave walls.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique Mechanics</h2>Each chapter introduces a new terrifying challenge. Such as sneaking around cave labyrinths, using camera systems, or time sensitive tasks.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lore and World Building</h2>The deeper you go, the more secrets get unturned...",
